  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RSF Reporters without Borders 2025-2027 - RSF Reporters without Borders 2025-2027 support</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RSF Reportrar utan Gr&#xe4;nser st&#xf6;d 2025-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den internationella organisationen Reportrar Utan Gr&#xe4;nser (RSF), med huvudkontor i Paris, har beviljats ett k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d p&#xe5; totalt 33 miljoner SEK, under tre &#xe5;r, fr&#xe5;n Sida f&#xf6;r att finansiera genomf&#xf6;randet av sin strategi, vilken de operationaliserat i en ans&#xf6;kan till Sida; &quot;Promote free, safe and independent journalism : Reporters Without Borders : The NGO for the right to information&quot;

Insatsen syftar till att f&#xf6;rsvara och fr&#xe4;mja journalistikens frihet, pluralism och oberoende,  inklusive f&#xf6;rsvaret av dem som f&#xf6;rkroppsligar dessa ideal, f&#xf6;r att garantera r&#xe4;tten till tillf&#xf6;rlitlig information. RSF har fyra strategiska prioriteringsomr&#xe5;den f&#xf6;r att n&#xe5; dit; 1) F&#xf6;rsvara och fr&#xe4;mja pressfrihet; 2) F&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra relationerna mellan allm&#xe4;nhet och journalister; 3) F&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra informationsmarknadens ekosystem; 4) Tillhandah&#xe5;lla strukturerade l&#xf6;sningar till informationsutrymmet.
RSF arbetar i partnerskap med, och vidarebefordrar medel till, andra organisationer och akt&#xf6;rer runt om i v&#xe4;rlden.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The international organization Reporters Without Borders (RSF), with headquarter in Paris, has been granted core support of a total of 33 million SEK, over three years, from Sida to finance the implementation of its strategy, which they operationalized in an application to Sida titled; &quot;Promote free, safe and independent journalism: Reporters Without Borders: The NGO for the right to information&quot;

The contribution aims to defend and promote the freedom, pluralism and independence of journalism to guarantee the right to reliable information and the defense of those who embody these ideals. RSF has four strategic priority areas to achieve this; 1) Defend and promote press freedom; 2) Improve relations between the public and journalists; 3) Improve the ecosystem within the information market; 4) Provide structural responses to the information space.
RSF works in partnership with, and forwards funds to, other organizations and actors around the world.</narrative>
  </description>
